    "headings": "<ul><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">\n        Thorium Reader for Desktop (3.2)\n        \n        Reading journeys\n      </span><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Thorium Reader</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">This is the documentation for Thorium 3, and it is a work in progress!</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Additional material available online</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Supported publication formats</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Keyboard functions</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Tactile gestures</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Opening Thorium Reader</span><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Windows, views and panels</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Main window</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Home View</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">\n          All publications View\n        </span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Grid Mode</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Table Mode</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Catalogs View</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Application Settings Panel</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Reading window</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Reading navigation panel</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Reading settings panel</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Book Information panel</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Library actions</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Opening a publication</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Open Publication menu</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Import a Publication</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Search publications (Filtering by keyword)</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Filter by tag (Grid mode)</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Sort by and Filter by (Table mode)</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Navigate by pages of your library</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Add tags</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Catalogs actions</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Setting up an OPDS catalog</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Example of OPDS feeds with LCP protected contents</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">OPDS Feed responsibility</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Setting up a french public library account</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Reading</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Zen Mode and Full screen </span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Search in a book</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Reading textual contents</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Text adjustment settings</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Theme</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Text</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Example 1: Setting Verdana as the reading font</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Example 2: Setting up Luciole as the reading font</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Display</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Spacing</span></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Reading visual contents</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Zooming on images</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Reading audio contents</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Audio only</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Readaloud, Text to speech (TTS)</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Text-to-speech options</span></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Reading PDFs</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Reading settings for PDFs</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Navigation features for PDFs</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Bookmarks and annotations for PDFs</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Printing PDF</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Navigation</span><li><span class=\"toc-h3\">Viewer controls</span></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Bookmarking</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Add a bookmark</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Reviewing and navigating the Bookmarks</span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"toc-h1\">Annotations</span><ul><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Annotations panel</span><li><span class=\"toc-h2\">Options for annotations</span><li><sp